WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.990
In autumn, a leaf falls to the ground.

2
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:06.950
By next summer, it has rotted
away to almost nothing.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.030
But the carbon in that
leaf can't simply vanish.

4
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.890
So where did it go, and how could
it end up inside a brand-new

5
00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:14.890
leaf?

6
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.310
In this mission, you'll see
how photosynthesis takes carbon

7
00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.060
dioxide out of the air.

8
00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:22.310
You'll find out how respiration,

9
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.730
decomposition and
combustion put it back.

10
00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.590
And you'll meet the decomposers:

11
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:31.030
the microorganisms that
break down dead material.

12
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:34.570
Your mission: trace the
carbon in a fallen leaf.
